        overtreatment: 'Total amputation for a tumour that allowed organ-sparing surgery.', nodalSurveillance: 'Nodal surveillance.', surveillanceHighRisk: 'Surveillance of an intermediate- or high-risk tumour: not recommended.',
        dsnb: 'Dynamic sentinel node biopsy: stages micrometastases.', radicalIlnd: 'Radical inguinal lymph node dissection.', lymphoedema: 'Risk of lymphoedema and wound complications.',
